   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">01 Sep 2020 | News Release: https://www.adb.org/news/adb-approves-274-million-loan-upgrade-roads-vital-uzbekistans-regional-connectivity</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Loan 3963: 100% of contracts awarded and 100% disbursed as of 01 Feb 2025</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Loan 3965: 95% of contracts awarded and 49% disbursed as of 01 Feb 2025</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">On 11 July 2023, the EA requested ADB&apos;s no objection to the extension of time to the civil works contracts for both packages up to mid-2024. The project is still on track to meet the target year of 2025. As of 24 July 2023, at the loan&apos;s elapsed time of 50%, the financial progress based on ADB-financed contract cost is 51.18% and 50.03% for package 1 and 2, respectively.

The civil works for the 240 km road section is divided into two packages (three 40 km lots each package). Contracts for package 1 for $100.91 million were signed on 5 April 2021, while contract for Package 2 for $96.61 million was signed on 3 May 2021. Commencement date were 4 June 2021 and 23 June 2021 for Package 1 and Package 2, respectively. The target completion date is June 2025 including a defect notification period of two years. The project management and construction supervision consultant commenced the services on 12 May 2021 until 11 May 2023.

Contract for package 1 (3 lots) was awarded to JV &quot;Polat Yol Yapi San. ve Tic. A.S. (TUR) and North West Construction LLC. The contract was signed on 5 April 2021 for total of $100.91 million.

Contract for package 2 (3 lots) was awarded to JV of China Road and Bridge Corporation, CCCC Third Highway Engineering Co., Ltd.. The contract 2 was signed on 3 May 2021 for total of $96.61 million.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Procurement of small civil works for community development has not started. In January 2023, the EA requested for a change of bidding procedure from 1S1E to 1S2E. Same status as above.</narrative>
    </title>
   </indicator>
